# ============================================================
# Multimodal Research Analysis Platform - .gitignore
# Rule 1: no real participant data, ever. Only the synthetic demo
# participant 123456789 is allowed.
# ============================================================

# --- Participant data: folders ---
/211/
/database/participants/*
!/database/participants/participant_123456789/
/sample_data/
/docs/sample_data/
**/Patient */

# --- Any file or folder whose name contains 211 ---
*211*

